  "text": "Donate to Charak Samhita New Edition Project\n\nCharak Samhita New Edition is a live and continuous project. Charak Samhita Research, Training and Skill Development Centre is established for fulfilling the objectives of this project . The academic and research activities of center are fully supported by FHED (India) Trust, New Delhi, India. The treasure of knowledge in ancient science of life - Ayurveda is invaluable. Your contribution will help us to propagate the knowledge further on this platform.\n\nContents\n\n1 Your contributions\n\n2 Tax Exemption\n\n3 Account Details\n\n4 Transaction Details\n\n5 Other modes of payment\n\n6 Social media links\n\nYour contributions\n\nYour monetary contribution can support following activities included in the project :\n\nCreate research based scholarly articles on important topics of healthcare as available on Concepts and Contemporary Practices\n\nCreate and continuously update Charak Samhita to make it most contemporary edition and its publication as available on Contents\n\nSponsor research fellowships to bright scholars like Charak Research Fellowships, Prof. M.S.Baghel Memorial Research Fellowships at Institute of Teaching and Research in Ayurveda, Jamnagar, India\n\nHonorarium for active content contributors\n\nOrganize Educational talk series on health and other important social issues\n\nOrganize competitions on important topics like essay competition on health\n\nOrganize meetings of editors and advisors\n\nMake audio-visual presentations by healthcare professionals and Ayurveda scholars\n\nSupport technical and software requirements\n\nConduct conferences and workshops, social awareness programs on healthcare\n\nTranslations of articles and transcriptions of videos\n\nSupport affiliated institutional researches\n\nTax Exemption\n\nDonors in India can claim tax exemption against 80G, for any donation.\n\nAccount Details\n\nWire Transfer / Internet Banking (NEFT/RTGS/IMPS): Donations to Charak Samhita Research, Training and Skill Development Centre through online and wire transfers can be sent to following account.\n\nAccount name: Symbiohealth Foundation\n\nBank name: State Bank of India\n\nType of account: Current account\n\nAccount number: 00000042795943651\n\nBranch IFSC: SBIN0000313\n\nMICR: 388002001\n\nSWIFT Code : SBININBB404\n\nFor any queries please mail us on carakasamhita@gmail.com\n\nTransaction Details\n\nWhen you have finished making a donation, kindly mail following details to carakasamhita@gmail.com.\n\nYour Full Name\n\nProfession and area of interest\n\nContact details(optional)\n\nYour Location  (City, country)\n\nTransaction Reference\n\nThis information will help us in acknowledging your contribution.\n\nOther modes of payment\n\nPayment through other modes like Paytm, Google pay, phone pay, BHIM, Amazon pay etc. is accepted in the same account.\n\nSocial media links",
