rticle\"/>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"http:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"article\",\"name\":\"Donate and contribute to Charak Samhita New Edition Project\",\"headline\":\"Donate and contribute to Charak Samhita New Edition Project\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"Donate\",\"identifier\":\"https:\\/\\/www.carakasamhitaonline.com\\/index.php?title=Donate\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.carakasamhitaonline.com\\/index.php?title=Donate\",\"description\":\"Donate and contribute to Charak Samhita New Edition Project\",\"keywords\":\"Donate, research project, Charak Samhita, new edition of Ayurveda, knowledge of life, science of life, educational talk series, competitions on health, Indian system of medicine, medicine, health, healthcare,  health systems, education, researches in Ayurveda, herbal medicine, herbo mineral medicine, authentic page of ayurveda, encyclopedia of ayurveda, wikipedia ayurveda, charak samhita, caraka samhita, carak samhita, charaka samhita , alternative medicine\",\"dateModified\":\"2024-10-29T10:19:01Z\",\"datePublished\":\"2024-10-29T10:19:01Z\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.carakasamhitaonline.com\\/resources\\/assets\\/cks.png\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Charak Samhita\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.carakasamhitaonline.com\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.carakasamhitaonline.com\\/resources\\/assets\\/cks.png\",\"caption\":\"Charak Samhita\"}},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Charak Samhita\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.carakasamhitaonline.com\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.carakasamhitaonline.com\\/resources\\/assets\\/cks.png\",\"caption\":\"Charak Samhita\"}},\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":\"https:\\/\\/www.carakasamhitaonline.com\\/index.php?title=Special:Search&search={search_term}\",\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term\"}}</script>\n<!--[if lt IE 9]><script src=\"/resources/lib/html5shiv/html5shiv.js\"></script><![endif]-->\n</head>\n<body class=\"mediawiki ltr sitedir-ltr mw-hide-empty-elt ns-0 ns-subject page-Donate rootpage-Donate skin-vector action-view skin-vector-legacy minerva--history-page-action-enabled\">\n<div id=\"mw-page-base\" class=\"noprint\"></div>\n<div id=\"mw-head-base\" class=\"noprint\"></div>\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"mw-body\" role=\"main\">\n\t<a id=\"top\"></a>\n\t<div id=\"siteNotice\" class=\"mw-body-content\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mw-indicators mw-body-content\">\n\t</div>\n\t<h1 id=\"firstHeading\" class=\"firstHeading\" lang=\"en\">Donate</h1>\n\t<div id=\"bodyContent\" class=\"mw-body-content\">\n\t\t<div id=\"siteSub\" class=\"noprint\">From Charak Samhita</div>\n\t\t<div id=\"contentSub\"></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"contentSub2\"></div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div id=\"jump-to-nav\"></div>\n\t\t<a class=\"mw-jump-link\" href=\"#mw-head\">Jump to navigation</a>\n\t\t<a class=\"mw-jump-link\" href=\"#searchInput\">Jump to search</a>\n\t\t<div id=\"mw-content-text\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\"><div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p>\n<p style=\"color:#00008b;font-size:24px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold\">Donate to Charak Samhita New Edition Project</p>\n<p><a href=\"/index.php?title=Charak_Samhita_New_Edition\" title=\"Charak Samhita New Edition\">Charak Samhita New Edition</a> is a live and continuous project. <a href=\"/index.php?title=Charak_Samhita_Research,_Training_and_Skill_Development_Centre\" title=\"Charak Samhita Research, Training and Skill Development Centre\">Charak Samhita Research, Training and Skill Development Centre</a> is established for fulfilling the objectives of <a href=\"/index.php?title=Charak_Samhita_New_Edition_(Wiki)_Project\" title=\"Charak Samhita New Edition (Wiki) Project\"> this project</a>. The academic and research activities of center are fully supported by FHED (India) Trust, New Delhi, India. The treasure of knowledge in ancient science of life -<a href=\"/index.php?title=Ayurveda\" title=\"Ayurveda\">Ayurveda</a> is invaluable. Your contribution will help us to propagate the knowledge further on this platform. \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Your_contributions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Your contributions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Tax_Exemption\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tax Exemption</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Account_Details\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Account Details</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Transaction_Details\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Transaction Details</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Other_modes_of_payment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other modes of payment</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Social_media_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Social media links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Your_contributions\">Your contributions</span></h2>\n<p>Your monetary contribution can support following activities included in <a href=\"/index.php?title=Charak_Samhita_New_Edition_(Wiki)_Project\" title=\"Charak Samhita New Edition (Wiki) Project\"> the project</a>:  \n</p>\n<ol><li>Create research based scholarly articles on important topics of healthcare as available on <a href=\"/index.php?title=Concepts_and_Contemporary_Practices\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Concepts and Contemporary Practices\">Concepts and Contemporary Practices</a></li>\n<li>Create and continuously update <a href=\"/index.php?title=Charak_Samhita\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Charak Samhita\">Charak Samhita</a> to make it most contemporary edition and its publication as available on <a href=\"/index.php?title=Contents\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Contents\">Contents</a></li>\n<li>Sponsor research fellowships to bright scholars like Charak Research Fellowships, Prof. M.S.Baghel Memorial Research Fellowships at Institute of Teaching and Research in Ayurveda, Jamnagar, India</li>\n<li>Honorarium for active content contributors</li>\n<li>Organize <a href=\"/index.php?title=Educational_talk_series_on_Health\" title=\"Educational talk series on Health\">Educational talk series on health</a> and other important social issues</li>\n<li>Organize competitions on important topics like <a href=\"/index.php?title=First_International_Essay_Competition%272020_on_Health_and_Ayurveda\" title=\"First International Essay Competition&#39;2020 on Health and Ayurveda\"> essay competition on health</a></li>\n<li>Organize meetings of editors and advisors</li>\n<li>Make audio-visual presentations by healthcare professionals and Ayurveda scholars</li>\n<li>Support technical and software requirements</li>\n<li>Conduct conferences and workshops, social awareness programs on healthcare</li>\n<li>Translations of articles and transcriptions of videos</li>\n<li>Support affiliated institutional researches</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tax_Exemption\">Tax Exemption</span></h2>\n<p>Donors in India can claim tax exemption against 80G, for any donation.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Account_Details\">Account Details</span></h2>\n<p><b>Wire Transfer / Internet Banking (NEFT/RTGS/IMPS):</b> Donations to <a href=\"/index.php?title=Charak_Samhita_Research,_Training_and_Skill_Development_Centre\" title=\"Charak Samhita Research, Training and Skill Development Centre\">Charak Samhita Research, Training and Skill Development Centre</a> through online and wire transfers can be sent to following account.\n</p><p><b>Account name:</b> Symbiohealth Foundation \n</p><p><b>Bank name:</b> State Bank of India\n</p><p><b>Type of account:</b> Current account\n</p><p><b>Account number:</b> 00000042795943651\n</p><p><b> Branch IFSC:</b> SBIN0000313\n</p><p><b>MICR:</b> 388002001\n</p><p><b>SWIFT Code</b>: SBININBB404  \n</p><p>For any queries please mail us on carakasamhita@gmail.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Transaction_Details\">Transaction Details</span></h2>\n<p>When you have finished making a donation, kindly mail following details to carakasamhita@gmail.com.\n</p>\n<ol><li>Your Full Name</li>\n<li>Profession and area of interest</li>\n<li>Contact details(optional)</li>\n<li>Your Location  (City, country)</li>\n<li>Transaction Reference</li></ol>\n<p>This information will help us in acknowledging your contribution.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_modes_of_payment\">Other modes of payment</span></h2>\n<p>Payment through other modes like Paytm, Google pay, phone pay, BHIM, Amazon pay etc. is accepted in the same account.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Social_media_links\">Social media links</span></h2>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLNivKu_tYLeonIfNCv7g-Pa1l77nWFurX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Youtube.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/af/Youtube.png/120px-Youtube.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/af/Youtube.png/180px-Youtube.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/af/Youtube.png/240px-Youtube.png 2x\" /></a>\n</td>\n<td><p style=\"border-left: 2px solid black; height: 50px;\">\n</p></td>\n<td><p style=\"margin-left: 3px;\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/charaksamhita.rtsdc.5/videos?lst=100002918323724%3A100053806389142%3A1598023294\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Facebook.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/fd/Facebook.jpg/120px-Facebook.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/fd/Facebook.jpg/180px-Facebook.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/fd/Facebook.jpg/240px-Facebook.jpg 2x\" /></a>\n</p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20250917172438\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 41/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key carakas1_carakasa:pcache:idhash:3566-0!canonical and timestamp 20250917172438 and revision id 44936\n -->\n</div></div><div class=\"printfooter\">Retrieved from \"<a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://www.carakasamhitaonline.com/index.php?title=Donate&amp;oldid=44936\">https://www.carakasamhitaonline.com/index.php?title=Donate&amp;oldid=44936</a>\"</div>\n\t\t<div id=\"catlinks\" class=\"catlinks catlinks-allhidden\" data-mw=\"interface\"></div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"mw-navigation\">\n\t<h2>Navigation menu</h2>\n\t<div id=\"mw-head\">\n\t\t<!-- Please do not use role attribute as CSS selector, it is deprecated. -->\n<nav id=\"p-personal\" class=\"vector-menu\" aria-labelledby=\"p-personal-label\" role=\"navigation\" \n\t >\n\t<h3 id=\"p-personal-label\">\n\t\t<span>Personal tools</span>\n\t</h3>\n\t<!-- Please do not use the .body class, it is deprecated. -->\n\t<div class=\"body vector-menu-content\">\n\t\t<!-- Please do not use the .menu class, it is deprecated. -->\n\t\t<ul class=\"vector-menu-content-list\"><li id=\"pt-login\